From a7cb755825c2d02bb0453a56894ab6f652aff4b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Olin <contact@chrisolin.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:17:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Limit the Glif landscape split to windows at least 600dp wide

layout-land-v31 splits every landscape window into equal header
and content panes. A 569dp-wide window gives the content pane
about 230px, so a 56sp title wraps mid-word and the footer is
squeezed out. Expressive layouts already select their wide
content at w600dp. Move the land-v31 content layouts to
layout-w600dp-land-v31 so narrower landscape windows keep the
single-column template.

Test: qualifier check, then Welcome on a 569dp-wide landscape window
